This repository contains a clean-room reimplementation of the functional
behavior of "NTR ToolBox" (originally by TheNano, distributed via GreasyFork),
plus an original task pipeline ("NTA-G" / nta-log) built on top of it.

The original work's source code is NOT included in or derived into this
repository's implementation; only its externally observable behavior was
reimplemented from scratch. The original "NTR ToolBox" remains the property
of its author under their own license terms, and this project claims no
rights over it.

